{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1468585-young-novas-erupting","id":1468585,"title":"Young Novas erupting","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-11-22T05:49:07-08:00","id":1468585,"title":"Young Novas erupting","content":"I'm not sure if it's been mentioned but I'm curious as to if there are any age requirements for a nova to erupt. Can you get child novas and if so how do you think that would affect the child depending on the powers they got. Is it implied that you need to have hit puberty for a person to erupt? Or has it been left to the storyteller to decide.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26058-aeonstorm","name":"Aeonstorm","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-22T08:43:06-08:00","id":1468597,"title":"","content":"I believe the psiad rules say that they usually gain their powers in their teens or twenties, but that younger and older aren't unheard of. I'd assume it would be the same way for novas. There is Teen Tomorrow as an example that not every nova is an adult, and the Chinese bodhisattva was supposedly an extraordinarily wise child.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-22T09:22:55-08:00","id":1468598,"title":"","content":"Yeah I was just thinking of pre-teen novas something like a 6 or 7 year old erupting maybe on N-day. I have though of different concepts like a dark star nova child with a couple of dots in each mega attribute, how would everyone and the world react to such a child and how would the child react to everyone and well meaning adults who she is suddenly completely superior to telling her what to do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26058-aeonstorm","name":"Aeonstorm","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-22T10:39:20-08:00","id":1468606,"title":"","content":"I think it would be possible for young teen, preteen, or even children to erupt. Keep in mind the usual triggers for erupting mean that there would be a high chance that a sizeable percentage would be from rough childhoods. Though on the other hand, I think it would be more common in children than adults to erupt do to a sense of wonder or desire as well","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4178-stanlemon","name":"stanlemon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-22T16:17:51-08:00","id":1468638,"title":"","content":"On the wonder and desire side, think of Reema the bird girl in &quot;Green Mansions.&quot; Picture the child of naturalists in a beautiful and dramatic setting. The child could develop powers related to the environment they're experiencing. <br /> <br /> Similarly, the child of anthropologists, historians, or diplomats, suddenly brought into a new society that to the child's inexperienced eyes seems magical and alluring. The child nova could have powers related to a child's understanding of the local culture and its myths.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}